[[:db/add "43f9089b-4be4-5beb-b87f-dd1cb4615e07" :answer/id #uuid "43f9089b-4be4-5beb-b87f-dd1cb4615e07"] [:db/add "43f9089b-4be4-5beb-b87f-dd1cb4615e07" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "43f9089b-4be4-5beb-b87f-dd1cb4615e07" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "43f9089b-4be4-5beb-b87f-dd1cb4615e07" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d" :answer-field/id #uuid "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d"] [:db/add "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d" :answer-field/choices "43f9089b-4be4-5beb-b87f-dd1cb4615e07"] [:db/add "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d" :answer-field/correct "43f9089b-4be4-5beb-b87f-dd1cb4615e07"] [:db/ensure "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "bb469924-993e-5c7e-b311-ec388a2df7ac" :answer/id #uuid "bb469924-993e-5c7e-b311-ec388a2df7ac"] [:db/add "bb469924-993e-5c7e-b311-ec388a2df7ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bb469924-993e-5c7e-b311-ec388a2df7ac" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "bb469924-993e-5c7e-b311-ec388a2df7ac" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff" :answer-field/id #uuid "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff"] [:db/add "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff" :answer-field/choices "bb469924-993e-5c7e-b311-ec388a2df7ac"] [:db/add "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff" :answer-field/correct "bb469924-993e-5c7e-b311-ec388a2df7ac"] [:db/ensure "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/id #uuid "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f"] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/28/28da4f28a9c39d920981931bc1f5244ed8c7b3ee95a4f03b4117cf9571df87a3.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/ba/ba64fc7f92d4394d5830087812d4046c85ee2a171d65d4686f6b2cdf85aee8b4.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $1$ square right. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square right. Thus $OX=1|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $4$ squares left and $4$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. Thus $XC=2|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=-2\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=1$ and $\\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/answer-fields "8900a31e-b760-59f6-9d42-13619e8da55d"] [:db/add "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/answer-fields "d9bd52fa-94c1-5132-a14e-d1f653c1a6ff"] [:db/ensure "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "3d06c7b2-cab2-5c7e-a403-4af7390c868f"] [:db/add "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/id #uuid "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232"] [:db/add "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232" :answer/validate] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/id #uuid "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364"] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/choices "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232"] [:db/add "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/correct "c2195ddc-16ef-54d4-bf1e-d660ed142232"] [:db/ensure "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/id #uuid "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9"] [:db/add "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae" :answer-field/id #uuid "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae"] [:db/add "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae" :answer-field/choices "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9"] [:db/add "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae" :answer-field/correct "f60da911-95b8-5e22-8506-5efd33ae91a9"] [:db/ensure "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/id #uuid "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2"] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/e2/e212c390e865aacd8ebc870fe46629cb254f7756ca77d9397fbd9d1cc6874315.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/98/987deafa84eb84d12dfa785cf4df946b641f8a06a08be1ca4a3392ed04732900.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $4$ squares right. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares left. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square left and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=2|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=-2\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-2\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-2$ and $\\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/answer-fields "88cbe9ca-4d2b-55b9-8ed9-1d2dc4b55364"] [:db/add "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/answer-fields "cb30707e-152e-5119-aa4c-ea9f9298e9ae"] [:db/ensure "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "a54e8346-5f1c-58f9-84d2-313a91208ad2"] [:db/add "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/id #uuid "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e"] [:db/add "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/value "-3"] [:db/ensure "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/id #uuid "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7"] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/choices "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e"] [:db/add "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/correct "6654157b-19f3-5165-b590-885853443f4e"] [:db/ensure "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/id #uuid "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521"] [:db/add "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/id #uuid "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903"] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/choices "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521"] [:db/add "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/correct "91d716f1-333f-5542-ac93-5b715d363521"] [:db/ensure "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/id #uuid "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c"] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/e9/e9a9adbc162bf6f73a5b2d058e4953b32528a6962a9b1c31ff7bef671e6c7c74.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/aa/aae1ea60df4eb3030354dc404cd0fc0670d46d46fa7ffe192129a30d5e59c77d.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $4$ squares left and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square down. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $6$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares down. Thus $XC=3|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=-3\\mathbf{a}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-2\\mathbf{b}-3\\mathbf{a}\\\\&=-3\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nReorder the terms to match their vector names. Since $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-3$ and $\\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/answer-fields "2da7ef41-a8de-5607-8ceb-230529f1eeb7"] [:db/add "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/answer-fields "3b041897-9ebd-5f3c-855c-7f4ea218b903"] [:db/ensure "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "95d1b819-7661-51b6-8c1b-3a0186d21c2c"] [:db/add "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/id #uuid "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b"] [:db/add "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/id #uuid "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4"] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/choices "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b"] [:db/add "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/correct "3ff846ff-78cf-54b1-8a9c-b03e12ad748b"] [:db/ensure "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/id #uuid "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd"] [:db/add "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf" :answer-field/id #uuid "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf"] [:db/add "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf" :answer-field/choices "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd"] [:db/add "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf" :answer-field/correct "e3bf800d-6128-53ab-9c2b-3105404b1bcd"] [:db/ensure "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb" :question/id #uuid "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb"] [:db/add "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/45/459c6127554e047ed5a7bb0500e73482ef0bf99fbd8b19e2506d5229c494032b.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/22/22dc092e8fed8174cf9862d441a63cad22b2f1430845f6d91eca795811a12358.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $6$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $4$ squares up. Thus $OX=\\frac{3}{2}|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $2$ squares left and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares left and $2$ squares up. Thus $XC=1|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-\\frac{3}{2}$ and $\\mu=1$."] [:db/add "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb" :question/answer-fields "a99a1852-7883-58d0-a6fa-709d048f87d4"] [:db/add "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb" :question/answer-fields "c4c1ef12-aea2-52f0-a601-c421122b04bf"] [:db/ensure "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "2e859a9d-08b6-5a6a-92af-dfb0da06cafb"] [:db/add "7d9cda34-27c0-54f7-8544-b1228d4b9007" :answer/id #uuid "7d9cda34-27c0-54f7-8544-b1228d4b9007"] [:db/add "7d9cda34-27c0-54f7-8544-b1228d4b9007" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7d9cda34-27c0-54f7-8544-b1228d4b9007" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "7d9cda34-27c0-54f7-8544-b1228d4b9007" :answer/validate] [:db/add "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad" :answer-field/id #uuid "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad"] [:db/add "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad" :answer-field/choices "7d9cda34-27c0-54f7-8544-b1228d4b9007"] [:db/add "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad" :answer-field/correct "7d9cda34-27c0-54f7-8544-b1228d4b9007"] [:db/ensure "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b" :answer/id #uuid "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b"] [:db/add "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b" :answer/value "-1"] [:db/ensure "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480" :answer-field/id #uuid "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480"] [:db/add "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480" :answer-field/choices "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b"] [:db/add "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480" :answer-field/correct "0d80de83-23fb-5988-8b20-6f765bdca74b"] [:db/ensure "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052" :question/id #uuid "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052"] [:db/add "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/e1/e189339fdfc92c2f28482b9bde1eb51d708ad00657a13a7825dfedc41be7e589.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/22/22ae29930c3abbe64477444305c7e807da389244b80482ecc5efff98e622d089.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $6$ squares right and $6$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. Thus $OX=3|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=3\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $1$ square down. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square up. Thus $XC=1|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=-\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=3\\mathbf{a}-\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=3$ and $\\mu=-1$."] [:db/add "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052" :question/answer-fields "02ee41c5-d646-5b4f-8d7e-4862bc96abad"] [:db/add "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052" :question/answer-fields "939136a2-8a81-5f0c-b1cf-ea79e500b480"] [:db/ensure "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "af143a63-5eb4-5be9-9b45-b262f6a28052"] [:db/add "1b1c38af-89e7-5bde-9a61-a05439cc2609" :answer/id #uuid "1b1c38af-89e7-5bde-9a61-a05439cc2609"] [:db/add "1b1c38af-89e7-5bde-9a61-a05439cc2609" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1b1c38af-89e7-5bde-9a61-a05439cc2609" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "1b1c38af-89e7-5bde-9a61-a05439cc2609" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0" :answer-field/id #uuid "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0"] [:db/add "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0" :answer-field/choices "1b1c38af-89e7-5bde-9a61-a05439cc2609"] [:db/add "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0" :answer-field/correct "1b1c38af-89e7-5bde-9a61-a05439cc2609"] [:db/ensure "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3c714363-675b-575f-9ad8-01ba638b4280" :answer/id #uuid "3c714363-675b-575f-9ad8-01ba638b4280"] [:db/add "3c714363-675b-575f-9ad8-01ba638b4280" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3c714363-675b-575f-9ad8-01ba638b4280" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "3c714363-675b-575f-9ad8-01ba638b4280" :answer/validate] [:db/add "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca" :answer-field/id #uuid "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca"] [:db/add "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca" :answer-field/choices "3c714363-675b-575f-9ad8-01ba638b4280"] [:db/add "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca" :answer-field/correct "3c714363-675b-575f-9ad8-01ba638b4280"] [:db/ensure "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c" :question/id #uuid "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c"] [:db/add "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/3c/3c8dffa921371d5719a7ebae77262b237202ca010112dd486aacfcdfa20aadbb.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/e8/e8d67f053baad27e5ab47d7f404212499809f4a966dfda5ef8e8473c19bbbeb9.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $6$ squares left. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $4$ squares right. Thus $OX=\\frac{3}{2}|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $6$ squares right and $3$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=3|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=3\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-\\frac{3}{2}\\mathbf{a}+3\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-\\frac{3}{2}$ and $\\mu=3$."] [:db/add "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c" :question/answer-fields "d8e44b7b-c018-5d09-adc7-f3733bba94a0"] [:db/add "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c" :question/answer-fields "479a592e-66cd-53e7-a7fa-df3c21e633ca"] [:db/ensure "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "02dc3e7a-1472-5d29-8332-3601bb80b51c"] [:db/add "ecac359e-b8cf-53af-a9f3-a8ae3c0be8c4" :answer/id #uuid "ecac359e-b8cf-53af-a9f3-a8ae3c0be8c4"] [:db/add "ecac359e-b8cf-53af-a9f3-a8ae3c0be8c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ecac359e-b8cf-53af-a9f3-a8ae3c0be8c4" :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2}"] [:db/ensure "ecac359e-b8cf-53af-a9f3-a8ae3c0be8c4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac" :answer-field/id #uuid "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac"] [:db/add "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac" :answer-field/choices "ecac359e-b8cf-53af-a9f3-a8ae3c0be8c4"] [:db/add "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac" :answer-field/correct "ecac359e-b8cf-53af-a9f3-a8ae3c0be8c4"] [:db/ensure "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "77c8afc2-1161-569e-b410-41570507f21c" :answer/id #uuid "77c8afc2-1161-569e-b410-41570507f21c"] [:db/add "77c8afc2-1161-569e-b410-41570507f21c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "77c8afc2-1161-569e-b410-41570507f21c" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "77c8afc2-1161-569e-b410-41570507f21c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f" :answer-field/id #uuid "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f"] [:db/add "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f" :answer-field/choices "77c8afc2-1161-569e-b410-41570507f21c"] [:db/add "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f" :answer-field/correct "77c8afc2-1161-569e-b410-41570507f21c"] [:db/ensure "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51" :question/id #uuid "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51"] [:db/add "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/a9/a9bed234c6890a31a075ac0adc6d2b40fc816e76bc836917a7768b4def7df960.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/b2/b2f03d3c8081b95f0b3fb456fe16c35431d92e861e46fe0c6de51bdbafc091f3.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $5$ squares right and $5$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares left and $2$ squares up. Thus $OX=\\frac{5}{2}|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $2$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares up. Thus $XC=1|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-\\frac{5}{2}\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=-\\frac{5}{2}$ and $\\mu=1$."] [:db/add "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51" :question/answer-fields "865a0160-afbc-533b-a29c-0a6092a620ac"] [:db/add "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51" :question/answer-fields "131cc78a-4bff-5807-a578-350492ed4a8f"] [:db/ensure "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "386ce298-7f5e-5b9f-ae64-004a4c7e4b51"] [:db/add "99ed2c36-e2ef-53a1-9238-89a9263c97d2" :answer/id #uuid "99ed2c36-e2ef-53a1-9238-89a9263c97d2"] [:db/add "99ed2c36-e2ef-53a1-9238-89a9263c97d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "99ed2c36-e2ef-53a1-9238-89a9263c97d2" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "99ed2c36-e2ef-53a1-9238-89a9263c97d2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7" :answer-field/id #uuid "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7"] [:db/add "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7" :answer-field/choices "99ed2c36-e2ef-53a1-9238-89a9263c97d2"] [:db/add "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7" :answer-field/correct "99ed2c36-e2ef-53a1-9238-89a9263c97d2"] [:db/ensure "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "249800cf-3298-5e9c-a90e-36b47954fc5c" :answer/id #uuid "249800cf-3298-5e9c-a90e-36b47954fc5c"] [:db/add "249800cf-3298-5e9c-a90e-36b47954fc5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "249800cf-3298-5e9c-a90e-36b47954fc5c" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "249800cf-3298-5e9c-a90e-36b47954fc5c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05" :answer-field/id #uuid "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05"] [:db/add "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05" :answer-field/choices "249800cf-3298-5e9c-a90e-36b47954fc5c"] [:db/add "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05" :answer-field/correct "249800cf-3298-5e9c-a90e-36b47954fc5c"] [:db/ensure "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11" :question/id #uuid "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11"] [:db/add "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/df/dfbb1c2b7b6a9d0526e917a12349300a4ffff7178f33d63d0dcfe04e1df2fc2b.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/f7/f7bd99f24d33518bd2ec1e6e901ae9cafafb57b3e25d7dd8b8d0451b4959598d.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $2$ squares right and $2$ squares down. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square left and $1$ square up. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $1$ square left. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares left. Thus $XC=\\frac{1}{2}|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{a}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=-2\\mathbf{b}+\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{a}\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{a}-2\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nReorder the terms to match their vector names. Since $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $\\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11" :question/answer-fields "ffc4b0ed-72e8-56a4-835b-1f315c1891c7"] [:db/add "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11" :question/answer-fields "37f5a787-0f1c-5286-a5b3-2215407b8d05"] [:db/ensure "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "93a0c8ae-a9f6-5bb5-a4ae-ea1b4ffe8a11"] [:db/ensure 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/validate]]
